{"id":"f9a14cb1ffb0e555","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MConseq.md","title":"MConseq","display":"MConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MConseq","parameters":["e","g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>e</span><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>e</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MConseq e g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ MFlags e)\n  (and\n    (@ FormsM g)\n    (and\n      (@ FmM a)\n      (forall w\n        (forall r\n          (forall v\n            (forall x\n              (implies\n                (and\n                  (@ MFrame e w r)\n                  (and (@ WorldVal w v) (and (in x w) (forall b (implies (in b g) (@ MSat e w r v x b))))))\n                (@ MSat e w r v x a)))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"852442b30ad8fc4e\" href=\"?note=852442b30ad8fc4e\" title=\"ZFC_FmM\">FmM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e80843a1c1c14dbd\" href=\"?note=e80843a1c1c14dbd\" title=\"ZFC_FormsM\">FormsM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"84cd239bcd7aaf85\" href=\"?note=84cd239bcd7aaf85\" title=\"ZFC_MFlags\">MFlags</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c535786457e5cab\" href=\"?note=6c535786457e5cab\" title=\"ZFC_MFrame\">MFrame</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e4fcc9b2d511fa9\" href=\"?note=4e4fcc9b2d511fa9\" title=\"ZFC_MSat\">MSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"beeed89974e85c6b\" href=\"?note=beeed89974e85c6b\" title=\"ZFC_WorldVal\">WorldVal</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MConseq e g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmM","status":"resolved","id":"852442b30ad8fc4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_FormsM|FormsM]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormsM","status":"resolved","id":"e80843a1c1c14dbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_FormsM|FormsM]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MFlags","status":"resolved","id":"84cd239bcd7aaf85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_FormsM|FormsM]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MFrame","status":"resolved","id":"6c535786457e5cab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_FormsM|FormsM]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat